{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节和情绪起伏不如X细致，尤其缺少随具体乐句出现的感受，部分音乐变化因此变得比较概括。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事和感受分成左右两栏，信息分工明确，心理变化也通过完整句子的因果关系自然展开，普通观众更容易在听音乐时跟住人物的心路历程。X的重点加亮和定时出现的感受很有优势，局部音乐与情绪的对应也更细，但部分感受意象过密、相互重复或跳跃，容易让注意力从人物正在经历的事情转移到词语本身。综合来看，Y更容易让人理解这段关系为什么一步步走到这里，X则更胜在音乐细节和局部感受的表现力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e9a44dc-cf8f-4162-b8b5-11657d3a59b7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043230304216Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:33:30.682606+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01b866154e1888b0080fa3051fb4a15c762a5d0336c382554a335aace021c201", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp